msgctxt ""
"Our contributors have been part of the RHEL ecosystem for a very long time, "
"and we recognized that the CentOS ecosystem is a very large and diverse "
"community."
msgid ""
"Our contributors have been part of the RHEL ecosystem for a very long time, "
"and we recognized that the CentOS ecosystem is a very large and diverse "
"community."
msgstr ""
