msgid "Stop by Booth #81"
msgstr "பூத் # 81 இல் நிறுத்தவும்"

msgctxt ""
"Find us right outside Ballroom B, and while you’re there grab some stickers "
"and swag, and sign up for your free t-shirt for AlmaLinux merch at "
msgid ""
"Find us right outside Ballroom B, and while you’re there grab some stickers "
