msgctxt ""
"With ELevate you can easily upgrade in-place from CentOS 6.x or 7.x "
"AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8. You can also use ELevate to upgrade from 8 "
"or 9 all the way through version 10 within the same OS. Used all over the "
"world to upgrade more than 500,000 devices, ELevate is your answer to the "
"headache of upgrading your operating system in the Enterprise Linux "
"ecosystem. "
msgid ""
"With ELevate you can easily upgrade in-place from CentOS 6.x or 7.x "
"AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8. You can also use ELevate to upgrade from 8 "
"or 9 all the way through version 10 within the same OS. Used all over the "
"world to upgrade more than 500,000 devices, ELevate is your answer to the "
"headache of upgrading your operating system in the Enterprise Linux "
"ecosystem. "
msgstr ""
"With ELevate you can easily மேம்படுத்தல் in-place இருந்து CentOS 6.x or 7.x "
"AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8. You can also use ELevate பெறுநர் "
"மேம்படுத்தல் இருந்து 8 or 9 அனைத்தும் the way through version 10 within the "
"same OS. Used அனைத்தும் வீச்சலகு the world பெறுநர் மேம்படுத்தல் more than "
"500,000 devices, ELevate is your பதில் பெறுநர் the headache of upgrading "
"your operating மண்டலம் in the நிறுவனம் Linux ecosystem. "

msgctxt "Upgrade from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8"
msgid "Upgrade from CentOS 7 to AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8"
msgstr "மேம்படுத்தல் இருந்து CentOS 7 பெறுநர் AlmaLinux 8 or CentOS Stream 8"

msgctxt "Didn't you used to support migrations to Rocky Linux?"
msgid "Didn't you used to support migrations to Rocky Linux?"
msgstr "Didn't you used பெறுநர் support migrations பெறுநர் Rocky Linux?"

msgctxt ""
"With the release of leapp-repository 0.23.0, two big things changed. First, "
"LEAPP now supports CentOS Stream natively, and the LEAPP team accepted a "
"pull request to add AlmaLinux support as well. That significantly reduces "
"the amount of work that we have to maintain in ELevate."
msgid ""
"With the release of leapp-repository 0.23.0, two big things changed. First, "
"LEAPP now supports CentOS Stream natively, and the LEAPP team accepted a "
"pull request to add AlmaLinux support as well. That significantly reduces "
"the amount of work that we have to maintain in ELevate."
msgstr ""
"With the release of leapp-repository 0.23.0, two big things changed. First, "
"LEAPP now supports CentOS Stream natively, and the LEAPP team accepted a "
"pull request பெறுநர் கூட்டு AlmaLinux support அச் well. That significantly "
"reduces the amount of வேலை that we have to maintain in ELevate."

msgctxt ""
"Second, the format of the migration data (the data the describes the package"
" upgrade paths) was changed. That meant that all supported OSes needed to "
"have their migration data updated to retain supporting upgrades."
msgid ""
"Second, the format of the migration data (the data the describes the package"
" upgrade paths) was changed. That meant that all supported OSes needed to "
"have their migration data updated to retain supporting upgrades."
msgstr ""
"இரண்டாவதாக, இடம்பெயர்வு தரவின் வடிவம் (தொகுப்பு மேம்படுத்தல் பாதைகளை "
"விவரிக்கும் தரவு) மாற்றப்பட்டது. உதவி மேம்படுத்தல்களைத் தக்கவைக்க, அனைத்து "
"ஆதரிக்கப்படும் OSகளும் அவற்றின் இடம்பெயர்வுத் தரவைப் புதுப்பிக்க வேண்டும் "
"என்பதாகும்."

msgctxt "You can read more"
msgid "You can read more"
msgstr "நீங்கள் மேலும் படிக்கலாம்"

msgctxt ""
"Yes! For the first four years of ELevate, we did support using ELevate to "
"upgrade out of date CentOS installations to Rocky Linux, and migrating "
"between major versions of Rocky Linux. As of the update to ELevate on "
"2025-11-03, that is no longer supported."
msgid ""
"Yes! For the first four years of ELevate, we did support using ELevate to "
"upgrade out of date CentOS installations to Rocky Linux, and migrating "
"between major versions of Rocky Linux. As of the update to ELevate on "
"2025-11-03, that is no longer supported."
msgstr ""
"ஆம்! ELevate இன் முதல் நான்கு ஆண்டுகளில், காலாவதியான CentOS நிறுவல்களை Rocky"
" Linux க்கு மேம்படுத்த ELevate ஐப் பயன்படுத்துவதற்கும், Rocky Linux இன் "
"முக்கிய பதிப்புகளுக்கு இடையே மாற்றுவதற்கும் நாங்கள் ஆதரவளித்தோம். 2025-11-03"
" அன்று உயர்த்தப்படும் புதுப்பித்தலின்படி, அது இனி ஆதரிக்கப்படாது."

